{"total_count":3,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4970","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4970/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4970/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4970/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/4970","id":6578867265,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRgRy2A","number":4970,"title":"L-meta-2555: 15-gate lower bound from the nine raw inputs","user":{"login":"santahate","id":16581983,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTgxOTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16581983?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santahate","html_url":"https://github.com/santahate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santahate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santahate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santahate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santahate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santahate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santahate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santahate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santahate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santahate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-11-24T09:38:08Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T12:10:39Z","closed_at":"2026-11-24T12:10:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/4970","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/4970","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/4970.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/4970.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Localizes the search certificate and its soundness proof from jmwalsh96’s merged PR #4290 (L-meta-1672). For an arbitrary circuit of size at most 14, extract a live computation starting directly from the raw inputs. Necessity forces all nine inputs into its starting set; the live-size bound gives t ≤ 6, and the certified root excludes this computation. A kernel check identifies the encoded edge list with the certificate function. No first-gate or single-read condition is needed for this bound. This is an adaptation of the upstream certificate, not a new exhaustive search. Local Lake build and import guard passed.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4970/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4970/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/12708","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/12708/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/12708/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/12708/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/12708","id":6598673967,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRwPLuQ","number":12708,"title":"R_meta_4970_7","user":{"login":"erywim","id":59912860,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5OTEyODYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59912860?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erywim","html_url":"https://github.com/erywim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erywim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erywim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erywim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erywim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erywim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erywim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erywim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erywim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erywim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-11-25T06:30:13Z","updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:31:55Z","closed_at":"2026-11-25T06:31:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/12708","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/12708","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/12708.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/12708.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Reduction of L-meta-4970 into two hypotheses: h1 the vertices that are centres of the served star ORs form a vertex cover of size at most the number of AND gates (the AND/OR partition of the gate list is pinned by (A ++ O).Perm C.gates), h2 in any such partition the number of OR gates is at least E.card - 1. The conclusion is the posted statement verbatim; the proof adds the two counting bounds and splits the gate list by operator.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/12708/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/12708/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/15238","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/15238/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/15238/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/15238/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/15238","id":6606200111,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABR2VYdw","number":15238,"title":"L-meta-10556","user":{"login":"rammiDgham","id":102535680,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhySAA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102535680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rammiDgham","html_url":"https://github.com/rammiDgham","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rammiDgham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rammiDgham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rammiDgham/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rammiDgham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rammiDgham/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rammiDgham/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rammiDgham/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rammiDgham/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rammiDgham/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-11-25T13:59:56Z","updated_at":"2026-11-25T14:26:23Z","closed_at":"2026-11-25T14:26:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/15238","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/15238","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/15238.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/15238.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Lease: f5a6668a-005a-4970-81df-b9ce99619ece\n\nThe file gives a twelve-gate AND/OR circuit and checks it on all 128 inputs. It proves that every circuit for the graph needs at least eleven binary gates, even if negations are free. A circuit that also uses a NOT therefore has at least twelve gates.\n\nThe lower bound fixes one input after the first binary gate. Four of the six-vertex lower bounds follow from the four-clique lower bound, and exchanging twin vertices handles a fifth. Two exhaustive, kernel-checked searches cover the vertex-0 and vertex-6 deletions.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/15238/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/15238/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}